:null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-27T18:38:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T19:51:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4.1, 4.5.beta6\nNot reproducible in 4.3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta6 - EndeavourOS SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Wed, 20 Aug 2025 21:43:45 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR) - AMD Ryzen 7 4800U with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 14.98 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nStarting Godot (both editor and games) without vulkan pipeline cache causes it to crash on exit:\n```\nJob 1, '~/Download/Godot_v4.4.1-stable_…' terminated by signal SIGSEGV (Address boundary error)\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDelete the pipeline cache:\n```sh\nrm -r ~/.local/share/godot/app_userdata/crash-on-exit/vulkan/\n```\nThen start Godot and exit.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[crash-on-exit.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22011772/crash-on-exit.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110031/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}